  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. The Baxter operators (12.38) and (12.39). Convention f^{[2n]}(u) = f(u + n h), D f(u) = f(u+h). Nothing is solved here. ---- *)\nClearAll[shift, OpO, OpOdag, OpOpoly, OpOdagPoly];\n(* D^n acting on a function *)\nshift[f_, n_][x_] := f[x + n h];\n(* O = 1 - T1/nu1 D^-1 + T2/(nu1 nu1^[-2]) D^-2 - T3/(nu1 nu1^[-2] nu1^[-4]) D^-3 *)\nOpO[T1_, T2_, T3_][f_][x_] :=\n  f[x]\n  - (T1 /. u -> x)/nu1[x] f[x - h]\n  + (T2 /. u -> x)/(nu1[x] nu1[x - h]) f[x - 2 h]\n  - (T3 /. u -> x)/(nu1[x] nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h]) f[x - 3 h];\n(* Odag = 1 - T1^[2]/nu3^[2] D + T2^[4]/(nu3^[2] nu3^[4]) D^2 - T3^[6]/(nu3^[2] nu3^[4] nu3^[6]) D^3 *)\nOpOdag[T1_, T2_, T3_][g_][x_] :=\n  g[x]\n  - (T1 /. u -> x + h)/nu3[x + h] g[x + h]\n  + (T2 /. u -> x + 2 h)/(nu3[x + h] nu3[x + 2 h]) g[x + 2 h]\n  - (T3 /. u -> x + 3 h)/(nu3[x + h] nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h]) g[x + 3 h];\n(* the same two equations cleared of denominators, convenient for polynomial q *)\nOpOpoly[T1_, T2_, T3_][f_][x_] := Expand[nu1[x] nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h] f[x] - (T1 /. u -> x) nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h] f[x - h] + (T2 /. u -> x) nu1[x - 2 h] f[x - 2 h] - (T3 /. u -> x) f[x - 3 h]];\nOpOdagPoly[T1_, T2_, T3_][g_][x_] := Expand[nu3[x + h] nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h] g[x] - (T1 /. u -> x + h) nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h] g[x + h] + (T2 /. u -> x + 2 h) nu3[x + 3 h] g[x + 2 h] - (T3 /. u -> x + 3 h) g[x + 3 h]];\nGrid[{\n  {\"O acts as O qhat_i^{[2]}(u) = 0, i.e. on the function u -> qhat_i(u+h)\", \"(12.40)\"},\n  {\"nu_1^{[-2]}(u), nu_1^{[-4]}(u)\", {nu1[u - h], nu1[u - 2 h]}},\n  {\"nu_3^{[2]}(u), nu_3^{[4]}(u), nu_3^{[6]}(u)\", {nu3[u + h], nu3[u + 2 h], nu3[u + 3 h]}},\n  {\"cleared form agrees with O times nu_1 nu_1^[-2] nu_1^[-4]\", Simplify[OpOpoly[t1, t2, t3][ff][u] - nu1[u] nu1[u - h] nu1[u - 2 h] OpO[t1, t2, t3][ff][u]] === 0},\n  {\"cleared form agrees with Odag times nu_3^[2] nu_3^[4] nu_3^[6]\", Simplify[OpOdagPoly[t1, t2, t3][gg][u] - nu3[u + h] nu3[u + 2 h] nu3[u + 3 h] OpOdag[t1, t2, t3][gg][u]] === 0}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
