      {
       "data": "Out[39]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{weights of the 8 basis vectors} & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 0\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{position of weight [2,1,0]} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum vector} & \\left\\{1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{is a joint eigenvector of all T\\_a coefficients} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_1 eigenvalue} & -2\\,h\\,z1-h\\,z2-\\mathrm{th}\\,z1-\\mathrm{th}\\,z2-\\mathrm{th}\\,z3+u\\,z1+u\\,z2+u\\,z3\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_2 eigenvalue} & 3\\,h^2\\,z1\\,z2+4\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,z1\\,z2+3\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,z1\\,z3+2\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,z2\\,z3-4\\,h\\,u\\,z1\\,z2-3\\,h\\,u\\,z1\\,z3-2\\,h\\,u\\,z2\\,z3+\\mathrm{th}^2\\,z1\\,z2+\\mathrm{th}^2\\,z1\\,z3+\\mathrm{th}^2\\,z2\\,z3-2\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u\\,z1\\,z2-2\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u\\,z1\\,z3-2\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u\\,z2\\,z3+u^2\\,z1\\,z2+u^2\\,z1\\,z3+u^2\\,z2\\,z3\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_3 eigenvalue} & -8\\,h^2\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3+8\\,h^2\\,u\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3-6\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}^2\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3+12\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3-6\\,h\\,u^2\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3+\\mathrm{th}^3\\,\\left(-z1\\right)\\,z2\\,z3+3\\,\\mathrm{th}^2\\,u\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3-3\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u^2\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3+u^3\\,z1\\,z2\\,z3\\\\\\hline\\text{matches sum\\_\\{|I… [latex truncated: 1320 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8f772f11-e69c-4588-8ea8-11a09ac0e6a8"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Baxter check on the vacuum: Q_1(u) = z1^{u/h} must satisfy O Q_1^{[2]}(u) = 0. ---- *)\nClearAll[Q1vac, Q1sh, resO, resOpoly, Q3vac, resOdag, T1v, T2v, T3v];\n{T1v, T2v, T3v} = Table[TvacDiag[a], {a, 3}];\nQ1vac[x_] := z1^(x/h);\nQ1sh[x_] := Q1vac[x + h];             (* the argument of O is qhat_1^{[2]} *)\n(* raw operator form and cleared form, both divided by the common exponential *)\nresO = Simplify[OpO[T1v, T2v, T3v][Q1sh][u]/Q1vac[u]];\nresOpoly = Simplify[OpOpoly[T1v, T2v, T3v][Q1sh][u]/Q1vac[u]];\n(* dual counterpart: Odag Q^3 = 0 with Q^3(u) = z3^{-u/h} *)\nQ3vac[x_] := z3^(-x/h);\nresOdag = Simplify[OpOdagPoly[T1v, T2v, T3v][Q3vac][u]/Q3vac[u]];\nGrid[{\n  {\"Q_1(u)\", Q1vac[u]},\n  {\"Q_1^{[2]}(u) = Q_1(u+h)\", Simplify[Q1sh[u]]},\n  {\"O Q_1^{[2]}(u) / Q_1(u)   (12.40, direct)\", resO},\n  {\"cleared form, same residual\", resOpoly},\n  {\"BAXTER SATISFIED (direct)\", resO === 0 && resOpoly === 0},\n  {\"Odag Q^3(u) / Q^3(u) with Q^3 = z3^{-u/h}\", resOdag},\n  {\"BAXTER SATISFIED (dual)\", resOdag === 0}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
