\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.5369em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.6631em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0231em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.5461em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.0231em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.839em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.0461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.5231em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0231em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[48]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{Q\\_1(u)} & z1^{\\frac{u}{h}}\\\\\\hline\\text{Q\\_1\\^{}\\{[2]\\}(u) = Q\\_1(u+h)} & z1^{\\frac{h+u}{h}}\\\\\\hline\\text{O Q\\_1\\^{}\\{[2]\\}(u) / Q\\_1(u)   (12.40, direct)} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{cleared form, same residual} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{BAXTER SATISFIED (direct)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{Odag Q\\^{}3(u) / Q\\^{}3(u) with Q\\^{}3 = z3\\^{}\\{-u/h\\}} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{BAXTER SATISFIED (dual)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8e5c34a0-ef49-422d-a32d-ceb9a3f84aa9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Results: chain, Baxter operators, vacuum\n\nEverything below is exact and symbolic in `u, theta, h, z1, z2, z3` — no numerics, no solving.\n\n**Chain (cell 3).** `deg T_{a,1} = a` (= `a L` at `L=1`); `T_{3,1} = z1 z2 z3 nu_1^{[-4]}nu_2^{[-2]}nu_3`; all coefficients of `T_1, T_2, T_3` mutually commute; they commute with the Cartan generators; `T_1` does **not** commute with `E_12`, so the diagonal twist is genuinely acting.\n\n**Baxter operators (cell 4).** `O` and `O^dagger` entered exactly as (12.38), (12.39) with `f^{[2n]}(u) = f(u+nh)`. Both are also provided cleared of denominators (`OpOpoly`, `OpOdagPoly`), and the cleared forms are verified to equal the operators times `nu_1 nu_1^{[-2]}nu_1^{[-4]}` and `nu_3^{[2]}nu_3^{[4]}nu_3^{[6]}` respectively.\n\n**Vacuum (cell 5).** The weight-`[2,1,0]` vector sits at position 1 of the Gelfand-Tsetlin basis, i.e. it is `(1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0)`. It is a joint eigenvector of every coefficient of every `T_a`, and its eigenvalues are\n\n$$T_{a,1}(u)\\big|_{\\rm vac} \\;=\\; \\sum_{i_1<\\cdots<i_a} z_{i_1}\\cdots z_{i_a}\\; \\nu_{i_1}(u-(a-1)h)\\,\\nu_{i_2}(u-(a-2)h)\\cdots\\nu_{i_a}(u),$$\n\nverified against the explicit diagonalization for `a = 1,2,3`. In particular `T_{1,1} = z_1\\nu_1 + z_2\\nu_2 + z_3\\nu_3`.\n\n**Baxter check (cell 6).** With those eigenvalues,\n\n$$\\mathcal O\\,Q_1^{[2]}(u) = 0 \\quad\\text{for}\\quad Q_1(u) = z_1^{u/h}$$\n\nholds identically — residual exactly `0`, in both the raw and the cleared form. The dual counterpart `O^dagger Q^3(u) = 0` with `Q^3(u) = z_3^{-u/h}` also holds identically, which validates the `O^dagger` implementation as well.\n\n**GT / SoV dictionary (cell 8).** `ps[]` returns patterns as `{{m11},{m12,m22},{lambda}}`. The SoV labelling is\n\n$$x_{21} = m_{12},\\qquad x_{11} = m_{11},\\qquad x_{12} = m_{22},$$\n\nthat is `{{a},{b,c}} -> {{b},{a,c}}`: the row-2 *first* entry becomes the singleton, and the row-1 entry is paired with the row-2 *second* entry. Applied to the eight GT patterns this reproduces the SoV list exactly, as a set. There is **no shift** — the two lists differ only by this permutation of roles.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 5. Dictionary between the code's GT patterns and the SoV variables {{x21},{x11,x12}}. ---- *)\n(* ps[] returns {{m11},{m12,m22},{lambda}}. The SoV labelling takes the row-2 FIRST entry as the\n   singleton x21, and pairs the row-1 entry with the row-2 SECOND entry:  {{a},{b,c}} -> {{b},{a,c}},\n   i.e.  x21 = m12,  x11 = m11,  x12 = m22.  This is a permutation of roles, NOT a shift. *)\nClearAll[codePats, toSoV, mapped, userList];\ncodePats = Most /@ ps[{{2, 1, 0}}];\ntoSoV[{{a_}, {b_, c_}}] := {{b}, {a, c}};\nmapped = toSoV /@ codePats;\nuserList = {{{2}, {2, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {0, 0}}};\nGrid[Join[\n  {{\"basis #\", \"GT pattern {{m11},{m12,m22}}\", \"SoV {{x21},{x11,x12}}\"}},\n  Table[{k, codePats[[k]], mapped[[k]]}, {k, dd}],\n  {{\"as a set, equals the SoV list\", Sort[mapped] === Sort[userList], SpanFromLeft}}\n  ], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639560\" data-output-id=\"69\" data-out-n=\"54\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[54]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"10\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.04em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">basis #</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.39em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">as a set, equals the SoV list</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GT pattern {{m11},{m12,m22}}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcente