le=\"top:-1.8116em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">th</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">th</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.5683em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7917em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.0834em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.7917em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2917em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2917em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9834em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2917em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1834em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2917em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3834em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2917em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5834em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2917em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7917em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[98]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{redBax validated: Q\\_1 = z1\\^{}\\{u/h\\} means P = 1, zk = z1} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{reduced equation for P (degree of the residual in u)} & 6\\\\\\hline\\text{number of linear equations for the cc[m]} & 7\\\\\\hline\\text{general polynomial solution, degMax = 4} & \\mathrm{cc}\\left(1\\right)\\,\\left(\\frac{-h\\,z1+2\\,h\\,z2-\\mathrm{th}\\,z1+\\mathrm{th}\\,z2}{z1-z2}+u\\right)\\\\\\hline\\text{free parameters left} & 1\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1372eea9-0b5c-4662-b908-76398b8187c4"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<span style=\"display:none\"></span>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1fc745f0-6a9d-4cb2-a462-e0f82e8d1d6c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 10. The polynomial parts of Q_1, Q_2, Q_3, monic, and a full Baxter check on each. ---- *)\nClearAll[polyPart, PP, Qfun, degTab, baxTab, rootTab];\n(* solve redBax[zk, P] = 0 for a polynomial P of degree <= dmax; return it monic *)\npolyPart[zk_, dmax_] := Module[{c, Pf, r, e, s, p, dg},\n   Pf = Function[y, Evaluate[Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, dmax}]]];\n   r = Together[redBax[zk, Pf][u]];\n   e = Thread[CoefficientList[Collect[Numerator[r], u], u] == 0];\n   s = Solve[e, Array[c, dmax + 1, 0]];\n   If[s === {}, Return[\"NO SOLUTION\"]];\n   p = Simplify[Pf[u] /. First[s]];\n   dg = Exponent[p, u];\n   Simplify[p/Coefficient[p, u, dg]]];\nPP[1] = polyPart[z1, 4];\nPP[2] = polyPart[z2, 4];\nPP[3] = polyPart[z3, 4];\nQfun[k_][xx_] := {z1, z2, z3}[[k]]^(xx/h) (PP[k] /. u -> xx);\ndegTab = Table[Exponent[PP[k], u], {k, 3}];\nrootTab = Table[If[degTab[[k]] > 0, Simplify[u /. Solve[PP[k] == 0, u]], {}], {k, 3}];\n(* full Baxter check: O Q_k^{[2]} = 0, using the POLYNOMIAL T's *)\nbaxTab = Table[Simplify[redBax[{z1, z2, z3}[[k]], Function[y, PP[k] /. u -> y]][u]] === 0, {k, 3}];\nGrid[{\n  {\"monic P_1(u)\", PP[1]},\n  {\"monic P_2(u)\", PP[2]},\n  {\"monic P_3(u)\", PP[3]},\n  {\"degrees (deg P_k = lambda_1 - mu_k with mu = (2,1,0))\", degTab},\n  {\"Bethe roots\", rootTab},\n  {\"Baxter satisfied for k = 1,2,3\", baxTab}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
