  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 14. THE EXPANSION: normalised det = sum_ns c[ns] <x_ns|Psi_B>, all Q abstract. ---- *)\n(* det = sum_ns c[ns] Psi_B[ns]; dividing by Psi_B[{1,0,0}] turns Psi_B[ns] into <x_ns|Psi_B>\n   and leaves the SAME c[ns]. The c[ns] are polynomials in the DUAL Q's only, i.e. in the\n   Q-functions of the other state. The label ns runs over the full lattice {0,1,2}^3. *)\nClearAll[monsU, Amat, bvec, cSol, cAssoc, suppC, resid];\n(* columns: Psi_B[ns] for every ns; rows: direct monomials. b: the dual-valued coefficients of det *)\nModule[{vs = Union@Cases[Join[PsiBa /@ cube, {detA[trG[[1]]]}], au[_, _], Infinity], crB, crD},\n  crB = Association[CoefficientRules[Expand[#], vs]] & /@ (PsiBa /@ cube);\n  crD = Association[CoefficientRules[Expand[detA[trG[[1]]]], vs]];\n  monsU = Union[Join @@ (Keys /@ crB), Keys[crD]];\n  Amat = Transpose[Table[Lookup[cb, Key /@ monsU, 0], {cb, crB}]];\n  bvec = Lookup[crD, Key /@ monsU, 0];\n];\ncSol = LinearSolve[Amat, bvec];\ncAssoc = AssociationThread[cube -> cSol];\nsuppC = Select[cube, cAssoc[#] =!= 0 &];\n(* verify the expansion reproduces the determinant exactly *)\nresid = Expand[detA[trG[[1]]] - Sum[cAssoc[ns] PsiBa[ns], {ns, cube}]];\nGrid[{\n  {\"number of ns labels\", Length[cube]},\n  {\"dim span of Psi_B over all ns\", MatrixRank[Amat]},\n  {\"dim of det's direct side\", MatrixRank[Transpose[Append[Transpose[Amat], bvec]]]},\n  {\"ns with c[ns] != 0\", suppC},\n  {\"how many\", Length[suppC]},\n  {\"EXPANSION EXACT: det - sum_ns c[ns] Psi_B[ns] = 0\", resid === 0},\n  {\"c[ns] involve only dual Q's\", Union@Cases[cSol, au[_, _], Infinity] === {}}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
