      {
       "data": "Out[148]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{det = sum\\_\\{ns,ms\\} M[ns,ms] Psi\\_A[ms] Psi\\_B[ns] EXACT} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{nonzero M entries (of 27x27)} & 29\\\\\\hline\\text{distinct ns / ms appearing} & \\left\\{17,17\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{entries on ns == ms} & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{M is NOT diagonal} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{all entries are dyadic rationals over h\\^{}6} & \\left\\{-\\frac{1}{2},-\\frac{3}{8},-\\frac{1}{4},-\\frac{1}{8},\\frac{1}{8},\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{3}{8},\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{3}{4}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{M table (ns <- ms, value x h\\^{}6)} & \\begin{matrix}\\left\\{0,0,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{0,0,0\\right\\}\\text{   }\\frac{1}{8}\\\\\\left\\{0,1,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{1,0,0\\right\\}\\text{   }-\\frac{1}{4}\\\\\\left\\{1,0,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{0,0,1\\right\\}\\text{   }-\\frac{1}{4}\\\\\\left\\{1,0,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{1,0,0\\right\\}\\text{   }\\frac{1}{4}\\\\\\left\\{0,0,2\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{0,1,1\\right\\}\\text{   }\\frac{3}{8}\\\\\\left\\{0,0,2\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{1,0,1\\right\\}\\text{   }-\\frac{3}{8}\\\\\\left\\{0,2,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{0,1,1\\right\\}\\text{   }-\\frac{1}{8}\\\\\\left\\{0,2,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{1,0,1\\right\\}\\text{   }\\frac{1}{8}\\\\\\left\\{1,1,0\\right\\}\\text{ <- }\\left\\{0,1,1\\ri… [latex truncated: 2746 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "9d1228af-d611-4550-9ef7-86deeedc0684"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. The expansion, with all `Q` abstract\n\nThe normalised determinant expands into wave functions, with `ns` running over the lattice `{0,1,2}^3`:\n\n$$\\frac{\\det N}{\\Psi_B(\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\})} \\;=\\; \\sum_{ns} c[ns]\\,\\langle x_{ns}|\\Psi_B\\rangle, \\qquad \\det N = \\sum_{ns} c[ns]\\,\\Psi_B[ns],$$\n\nwith `c[ns]` polynomials in the **dual** `Q^j` alone — the `Q`'s of the other state. Verified exactly: `det - sum_ns c[ns] Psi_B[ns] === 0` with all `Q` abstract (cell 20). Dividing by `Psi_B({1},{0,0})` leaves the `c[ns]` unchanged, since the factor cancels from both sides; its role is to convert `Psi_B[ns]` into the normalised `<x_ns|Psi_B>` of section 4.\n\nThe coefficients are themselves left wave functions: `c[ns]` lies in the span of `Psi_A[ms]`, so (cell 21)\n\n$$\\det N \\;=\\; \\sum_{ns,\\,ms} M[ns,ms]\\;\\Psi_A[ms]\\,\\Psi_B[ns],$$\n\nagain exact with all `Q` abstract. **`M` is strongly non-diagonal** — 29 nonzero entries, of which only 4 sit on `ns = ms`. Every entry is a dyadic rational over `h^6`, with no dependence on `theta[1]` or on the twist:\n\n| `ns` | `ms` | `h^6 M` | | `ns` | `ms` | `h^6 M` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `{0,0,0}` | `{0,0,0}` | `1/8` | | `{1,2,0}` | `{0,1,2}` | `-1/4` |\n| `{0,0,2}` | `{0,1,1}` | `3/8` | | `{1,2,0}` | `{1,0,2}` | `1/4` |\n| `{0,0,2}` | `{1,0,1}` | `-3/8` | | `{1,2,0}` | `{2,0,1}` | `-1/4` |\n| `{0,1,0}` | `{1,0,0}` | `-1/4` | | `{1,2,1}` | `{0,2,2}` | `-1/8` |\n| `{0,2,0}` | `{0,1,1}` | `-1/8` | | `{1,2,1}` | `{1,1,2}` | `1/2` |\n| `{0,2,0}` | `{1,0,1}` | `1/8` | | `{1,2,2}` | `{1,2,2}` | `1/4` |\n| `{0,2,1}` | `{0,1,2}` | `1/4` | | `{1,2,2}` | `{2,1,2}` | `-1/4` |\n| `{0,2,1}` | `{1,0,2}` | `-1/4` | | `{2,0,0}` | `{0,0,2}` | `1/8` |\n| `{0,2,2}` | `{1,1,2}` | `-1/2` | | `{2,0,0}` | `{1,0,1}` | `-1/8` |\n| `{0,2,2}` | `{2,0,2}` | `1/8` | | `{2,1,0}` | `{1,0,2}` | `-1/4` |\n| `{0,2,2}` | `{2,1,1}` | `3/8` | | `{2,1,0}` | `{2,0,1}` | `1/4` |\n| `{1,0,0}` | `{0,0,1}` | `-1/4` | | `{2,2,0}` | `{0,2,2}` | `1/8` |\n| `{1,0,0}` | `{1,0,0}` | `1/4` | | `{2,2,1}` | `{1,2,2}` | `-1/4` |\n| `{1,0,2}` | `{1,1,1}` | `3/4` | | `{2,2,2}` | `{2,2,2}` | `1/8` |\n| `{1,1,0}` | `{0,1,1}` | `1/2` | | | | |\n\nThe left wave function is the mirror of the right one, `Psi_A[{a,b,c}] = Q^1(x_a)[Q^1(x_b)Q^2(x_c+h) - Q^2(x_b)Q^1(x_c+h)]`, i.e. `Q_i -> Q^i` and `-h -> +h`. With that choice `Psi_A` samples the duals at exactly `n = 0,1,2,3` and `Psi_B` samples the directs at `n = -1,0,1,2`, each precisely the set the residues produce.\n\n**Uniqueness.** `Psi_A` and `Psi_B` each span 17 of the 27 labels, so `LinearSolve` returns one representative of `c[ns]` and of `M[ns,ms]`. Section 6 shows the grading forces every admissible representative onto `Total[ns] == Total[ms]`; the table above already satisfies that.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 16. M[ns,ms] is nonzero only when Total[ns] == Total[ms], forced by a grading. ---- *)\n(* Grading: deg au[i,n] = n, deg ad[j,n] = -n. Since Q_i(theta+nh) ~ z_i^n and Q^j(theta+nh) ~ z_j^{-n},\n   this is the rescaling of the twist eigenvalues z -> t z. Column by column,\n     G_1 = -Q^j Q_i        has degree n - n     =  0\n     G_2 = Q^j Q_i^{[-2]}  has degree (n-1) - n = -1\n     G_3 = Q^{j[2]} Q_i    has degree n - (n+1) = -1\n   each independent of n, so every column is homogeneous and det has degree 0 + (-1) + (-1) = -2. *)\nClearAll[grade, claimOK, viol, colHom, dHom, bHom, aHom, blockTab];\ngrade = {au[i_, n_] :> t^n au[i, n], ad[j_, n_] :> t^(-n) ad[j, n]};\nclaimOK = And @@ Table[Total[k[[1]]] === Total[k[[2]]], {k, suppM}];\nviol = Select[suppM, Total[#[[1]]] =!= Total[#[[2]]] &];\ncolHom = Table[Simplify[(gvecA[{i, j}, n] /. grade) - {1, t^(-1), t^(-1)} gvecA[{i, j}, n]], {i, 2}, {j, 2}, {n, 0, 2}];\ndHom = Simplify[(detA[trG[[1]]] /. grade) - t^(-2) detA[trG[[1]]]];\nbHom = Table[Simplify[(PsiBa[ns] /. grade) - t^(Total[ns] - 1) PsiBa[ns]], {ns, cube}];\naHom = Table[Simplify[(PsiAa[ms] /. grade) - t^(-(Total[ms] + 1)) PsiAa[ms]], {ms, cube}];\nblockTab = Table[{q, Count[suppM, k_ /; Total[k[[1]]] == q]}, {q, 0, 6}];\nGrid[{\n  {\"columns G_1, G_2, G_3 are homogeneous of degree 0, -1, -1 for every n\", Union@Flatten[colHom] === {0}},\n  {\"det is homogeneous of degree -2\", dHom === 0},\n  {\"Psi_B[ns] is homogeneous of degree Total[ns] - 1\", Union@Flatten[bHom] === {0}},\n  {\"Psi_A[ms] is homogeneous of degree -(Total[ms] + 1)\", Union@Flatten[aHom] === {0}},\n  {\"=> Psi_A[ms] Psi_B[ns] has degree Total[ns] - Total[ms] - 2; matching -2 FORCES Total[ns] == Total[ms]\", True},\n  {\"CHECK: M[ns,ms] != 0 only if Total[ns] == Total[ms]\", claimOK},\n  {\"violations\", viol},\n  {\"nonzero entries per charge sector {q, count}\", blockTab},\n  {\"total\", Total[blockTab[[All, 2]]]}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639560\" data-output-id=\"80\" data-out-n=\"158\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"26\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[158]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"10\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:18.0401em;vertical-align:-8.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-11.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:18.0001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-8.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">columns G_1, G_2, G_3 are homogeneous of degree 0, -1, -1 for every n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">det is homogeneous of degree -2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Psi_B[ns] is homogeneous of degree Total[ns] - 1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Psi_A[ms] is homogeneous of degree -(Total[ms] + 1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=&gt; Psi_A[ms] Psi_B[ns] has degree Total[ns] - Total[ms] - 2; matching -2 FORCES Total[ns] == Total[ms]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CHECK: M[ns,ms] != 0 only if Total[ns] == Total[ms]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">violations</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nonzero entries per charge sector {q, count}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.94em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:18.0001em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-8.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.86em