lass=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.7601em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;Psi|Psi&gt; = 1/(&lt;0|R_Psi&gt; &lt;L_Psi|0&gt;)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.1701em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:16.8402em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-8.1701em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.7001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.1402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.3402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.6701em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.1701em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[172]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{reference} & \\text{components in the GT basis}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0|} & \\left\\{1,a23,a12,a12\\,a23-a13,3\\,\\left(a12\\,a23+a13\\right),3\\,a23\\,\\left(a12\\,a23+a13\\right),-2\\,a12\\,a13,-3\\,a13\\,\\left(a12\\,a23+a13\\right)\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{|0>} & \\left\\{1,b32,b21,b21\\,b32-\\frac{b31}{2},\\frac{b31}{2},\\frac{b31\\,b32}{3},\\frac{1}{2}\\,b21\\,\\left(b21\\,b32-b31\\right),-\\frac{1}{3}\\,b31\\,\\left(b31-b21\\,b32\\right)\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{all T\\_a coefficients diagonal in this basis} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{state weights} & \\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 0\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum position} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{two-sided normalisation} & \\text{<Psi|Psi> = 1/(<0|R\\_Psi> <L\\_Psi|0>)}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f3d0fbac-6cdc-41d6-8635-98dd3c62a0e9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 18. Direct and dual Q-functions for every state. ---- *)\nClearAll[directRedAll, dualRedAll, monicBaxPolyAll, qDirPoly, qDualPoly,\n  qDegreeTable, qAllCheck];\n\ndirectRedAll[s_, zk_, Pf_][x_] := Expand[\n   zk nu1[x] nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h] Pf[x + h]\n   - (tEig[s, 1] /. u -> x) nu1[x - h] nu1[x - 2 h] Pf[x]\n   + (tEig[s, 2] /. u -> x) nu1[x - 2 h] Pf[x - h]/zk\n   - (tEig[s, 3] /. u -> x) Pf[x - 2 h]/zk^2];\n\ndualRedAll[s_, zk_, Pf_][x_] := Expand[\n   nu3[x + h] nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h] Pf[x]\n   - (tEig[s, 1] /. u -> x + h) nu3[x + 2 h] nu3[x + 3 h] Pf[x + h]/zk\n   + (tEig[s, 2] /. u -> x + 2 h) nu3[x + 3 h] Pf[x + 2 h]/zk^2\n   - (tEig[s, 3] /. u -> x + 3 h) Pf[x + 3 h]/zk^3];\n\nmonicBaxPolyAll[red_, 0] := If[FullSimplify[red[Function[y, 1]][u]] === 0, 1, $Failed];\nmonicBaxPolyAll[red_, d_Integer?Positive] := Module[{c, p, r, cls, mat, vec},\n   p = Sum[c[k] u^k, {k, 0, d}];\n   r = Expand[Numerator[Together[red[Function[y, Evaluate[p /. u -> y]]][u]]]];\n   cls = CoefficientList[r, u];\n   mat = Table[Coefficient[cls[[i]], c[k]], {i, Length[cls]}, {k, 0, d}];\n   vec = First[NullSpace[mat]];\n   Factor[(vec . Table[u^k, {k, 0, d}])/Last[vec]]];\n\nqDirPoly[s_, k_] := qDirPoly[s, k] =\n  monicBaxPolyAll[Function[pf, directRedAll[s, {z1, z2, z3}[[k]], pf]],\n    2 - stateMu[[s, k]]];\nqDualPoly[s_, k_] := qDualPoly[s, k] =\n  monicBaxPolyAll[Function[pf, dualRedAll[s, {z1, z2, z3}[[k]], pf]],\n    stateMu[[s, k]]];\n\nqDegreeTable = Table[\n   {s, stateMu[[s]], Table[Exponent[qDirPoly[s, k], u], {k, 3}],\n    Table[Exponent[qDualPoly[s, k], u], {k, 3}]}, {s, dd}];\n\nqAllCheck = {\n   And @@ Flatten@Table[\n      FullSimplify[directRedAll[s, {z1, z2, z3}[[k]],\n          Function[y, qDirPoly[s, k] /. u -> y]][u]] === 0, {s, dd}, {k, 3}],\n   And @@ Flatten@Table[\n      FullSimplify[dualRedAll[s, {z1, z2, z3}[[k]],\n          Function[y, qDualPoly[s, k] /. u -> y]][u]] === 0, {s, dd}, {k, 3}]\n   };\n\nGrid[Join[\n  {{\"state\", \"weight\", \"deg P_i\", \"deg P^j\"}},\n  qDegreeTable,\n  {{\"all 24 direct / all 24 dual Baxter equations\", qAllCheck, SpanFromLeft, SpanFromLeft}}\n  ], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
